  "content_html": "<div class=\"product-description j-product-description\" itemprop=\"description\">\n<div class=\"text\">\n<p data-end=\"191\" data-start=\"0\">Fill your life with sparkle and make your skin look even better with <strong data-end=\"99\" data-start=\"69\">«Shining Star» Bath Pearls</strong>.<br data-end=\"103\" data-start=\"100\"/>\r\nEnriched with natural oils and edible glitter, they leave your skin glowing like a star!</p>\n<p data-end=\"382\" data-start=\"193\"><strong data-end=\"208\" data-start=\"193\">Bath pearls</strong> are ultra-moisturizing beads for your skin that not only provide instant hydration but also make bath time more enjoyable while filling the room with a delightful fragrance.</p>\n<p data-end=\"551\" data-start=\"384\">Baths with bath pearls help soften and moisturize the skin, relax muscles and the nervous system, and improve the skin’s overall condition by enhancing its elasticity.</p>\n<p data-end=\"566\" data-start=\"553\"><strong data-end=\"566\" data-start=\"553\">Features:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li data-end=\"652\" data-start=\"568\"><strong data-end=\"597\" data-start=\"568\">Silver shimmering glitter</strong> adds a radiant glow and a subtle sparkle to your skin.</li>\n<li data-end=\"910\" data-start=\"654\"><strong data-end=\"676\" data-start=\"654\">Delicate fragrance</strong> leaves a light, long-lasting scent trail on the skin. <strong data-end=\"747\" data-start=\"733\">Top notes:</strong> blackcurrant, rose, geranium, pink pepper, jasmine. <strong data-end=\"818\" data-start=\"802\">Heart notes:</strong> freesia, lily, plum, musk. <strong data-end=\"863\" data-start=\"848\">Base notes:</strong> candy accord, oakmoss, sandalwood, soft amber.</li>\n<li data-end=\"983\" data-start=\"912\"><strong data-end=\"928\" data-start=\"912\">Natural oils</strong> provide additional care and nourishment for your body.</li>\n<li data-end=\"1508\" data-start=\"985\"><strong data-end=\"1002\" data-start=\"985\">Macadamia oil</strong> helps protect the skin from environmental stressors and keeps it deeply moisturized. Rich in saturated and unsaturated fatty acids, vitamin PP, and B vitamins, it helps improve the condition of problematic skin, soothes irritation, reduces dryness and flaking, and provides regenerating, moisturizing, and softening benefits. Its antioxidant properties help slow visible signs of aging, support the skin’s natural moisture balance, improve elasticity, and reduce the appearance of fine lines and wrinkles.</li>\n<li data-end=\"1770\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\" data-start=\"1510\"><strong data-end=\"1525\" data-start=\"1510\">Coconut oil</strong> nourishes the skin and gives it a beautiful, healthy-looking appearance. Rich in beneficial fatty acids, including pantothenic, folic, and caprylic acids, as well as vitamins B1 and C, it helps maintain youthful-looking, soft, and radiant skin.</li>\n</ul>\n </div>\n</div>",
